@gen.user.profile.kb core.note
    text="The interview plan: sections, fields (priority 1 to 10, sensitivity, question phrasings, follow-up, example), industries, reactions and activity words. Sensitive topics (health, religion, politics, sexuality, exact address, income, age) are deliberately absent: they are never asked for."
    core.source="specs/12-profile.md"

